cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as follows."

type: software

title: "Knowledge Mediation Platform"

authors:
  - family-names: Zullo
    given-names: Letícia Ferreira dos Santos

abstract: >-
  Knowledge Mediation Platform is an open-source software platform for building
  and evaluating intelligent document question-answering systems based on Large
  Language Models (LLMs). It provides reusable infrastructure for document
  ingestion, indexing, vector storage, retrieval, context construction,
  language model orchestration, and automatic evaluation, supporting
  reproducible research on intelligent knowledge mediation systems.

keywords:
  - Large Language Models
  - Intelligent Knowledge Mediation
  - Retrieval-Augmented Generation
  - Document Question Answering
  - Research Software
  - FastAPI
  - PostgreSQL
  - pgvector

license: MIT

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-07-15"

repository-code: "https://github.com/LZullo/knowledge-mediation-platform"
